(label "VOUT" (at 119.38 106.68 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e1c5c9d7-4ba3-4890-976c-21536c2897da"))
(text "LDO - TLV1117  |  Texas Instruments  |  15V 800mA adjustable LDO, SOT-223" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b559cc4-e698-4a55-95be-9834a4a071c3"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 1.8 V (fixed resistors - no trimmer). Pin-compatible family: pin1 ADJ/SET, pin2 + tab OUT, pin3 IN.\nOther outputs: change only the programming resistor(s) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9614f661-9b50-47cb-bf6e-19023e79900e"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - TLV1117 (TI TLV1117 datasheet SLVS561O (Jun 2025))\nDesign point: VOUT 1.8 V (default), VIN 5.0 V nominal (3.3 V rail also checked), IOUT rated 0.8 A, SOT-223\nOutput: VOUT = VREF*(1 + R2/R1) + IADJ*R2 ; VREF = 1.25 V, IADJ = 60 uA typ (120 max)\n  Min-load rule: VREF/R1 >= IMIN = 5 mA max -> R1 <= 250 ohm ; R1 = 124 ohm (divider current 10.1 mA)\n  R2 = (VOUT - VREF)/(VREF/R1 + IADJ) = 54.2 ohm -> 53.6 ohm (E96) ; VOUT = 1.7935 V (-0.36%)\n  IADJ error at IADJ max = 6.4 mV ; VREF tolerance +/-1% (25C) / +/-2% (full temp) dominates\n  R1 dissipation = VREF^2/R1 = 12.6 mW ; R2 = 5.5 mW (0603 OK)\nPSRR: ripple gain = VOUT/VREF = 1.44 -> PSRR degrades 3.2 dB without CADJ\n  CADJ > 1/(2*pi*f*R1): 120 Hz -> 10.7 uF ; 100 kHz post-regulator -> 12.8 nF\nDropout: VDO = 1.3 V max @ 0.8 A (C-grade; I-grade 1.4 V) -> VIN(min) = VOUT + VDO = 3.10 V at full load\n  3.3 V rail: headroom 1.50 V vs VDO 1.3 V -> OK ; 5 V rail: headroom 3.20 V -> OK\nCurrent limit: 0.8 A min / 1.2 A typ ; VIN(max) = 15 V\nCapacitors: Adjustable version is specified stable with tantalum / Al-electrolytic COUT, ESR 0.2-10 ohm (Note A).\n  Do NOT use only MLCC on the output.\nTHERMAL (thetaJA = 61.6 C/W, DCY, adj new chip, JEDEC; TJ(max) 125 C)\n  VIN 5.0 V: efficiency = VOUT*IOUT/(VIN*(IOUT+Idiv)) = 36% (max VOUT/VIN = 36%) ; temp rise dT = thetaJA*PD = 158 C\n  VIN 5.0 V: PD = (VIN-VOUT)*IOUT = 3.20*0.8 = 2.56 W -> TJ = 183C @25C / 243C @85C ; thermal IOUT(max) = 0.38 A @TA50C, 0.20 A @TA85C\n  VIN 3.3 V: efficiency = VOUT*IOUT/(VIN*(IOUT+Idiv)) = 54% (max VOUT/VIN = 55%) ; temp rise dT = thetaJA*PD = 74 C\n  VIN 3.3 V: PD = (VIN-VOUT)*IOUT = 1.50*0.8 = 1.20 W -> TJ = 99C @25C / 159C @85C ; thermal IOUT(max) = 0.80 A @TA50C, 0.43 A @TA85C\n  PD(max) = (125 - TA)/thetaJA = 1.22 W @50C, 0.65 W @85C. Add copper / heatsink or pre-regulate to raise current.\nProtection: D1 (1N4002-class, OUT->IN) per datasheet Note D - for input shorts with large COUT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 130.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5300faa-5f08-4f03-a0cd-192666710d8d"))
